WEBVTT

00:08.875 --> 00:16.916
Shiroi mikazuki machi wo miorosu koro ni

00:16.916 --> 00:24.914
Aoi meikyuu kara mashou ga mezame-hajimeru

00:32.432 --> 00:36.236
Tsumibukai kono chijou de, boy

00:36.236 --> 00:39.239
Believing, dreaming

00:39.239 --> 00:43.076
Boku-tachi wa sagashiteru

00:43.076 --> 00:48.207
Tamashii no mezasubeki basho wo

00:50.016 --> 00:58.425
Ah, dore kurai fukai yami hikari ni kaetara

00:58.425 --> 01:02.996
Sekai no iro ga kawaru?

01:02.996 --> 01:05.665
Ah, itsuka kitto

01:05.665 --> 01:13.940
Ah, dore kurai fukai nazo ikutsumo toitara

01:13.940 --> 01:18.900
Rakuen no doa wa hiraku?

01:20.447 --> 01:27.080
Bokura no tabi wo start hajimeyou

02:02.856 --> 02:06.348
The name of that serpent
is Midgardsormr.

02:06.960 --> 02:08.862
The spawn of an evil god,

02:08.862 --> 02:13.561
he was feared by all and
ultimately cast into the sea.

02:17.670 --> 02:22.509
Continuing to live at the bottom
of those cold, dark waters,

02:22.509 --> 02:26.206
he grew until he was so large that
he encircled the Earth itself.

03:22.602 --> 03:23.899
All righty!

03:32.145 --> 03:33.379
Master Loki!

03:33.379 --> 03:34.846
It's morning! Rise and shine!

03:36.282 --> 03:39.080
On the menu for today are Spanish omelets.

03:40.353 --> 03:44.050
Come now, please head down to
the table before they get cold.

03:53.499 --> 03:57.936
All right! It's the start of a brand
new day, Master Loki.

03:59.038 --> 04:04.670
The 8th Night
Onward, Yamino Detective Agency?!

04:05.745 --> 04:08.305
Hiya, Loki!

04:09.816 --> 04:11.443
Have any new cases?

04:12.752 --> 04:14.549
None at all.

04:15.855 --> 04:17.991
What kind of a dance is that?

04:17.991 --> 04:19.117
Dance?

04:21.261 --> 04:23.889
It looks like fun!
I'm going to do it too!

04:26.566 --> 04:26.799
"Up and down, side to side,
spin and twirl, hooray!"

04:26.799 --> 04:30.470
"Up and down, side to side,
spin and twirl, hooray!"
Master Loki, Mayura can't see Ecchan.

04:30.470 --> 04:30.731
"Up and down, side to side,
spin and twirl, hooray!"

04:31.004 --> 04:33.404
Huh? When did you show up, Yamino?

04:33.740 --> 04:35.901
Welcome back, Mayura!

04:36.843 --> 04:39.209
That's everything all right.

04:39.479 --> 04:41.581
Matan Bank

04:41.581 --> 04:43.249
Matan Bank
We appreciate your business.

04:43.249 --> 04:43.647
Matan Bank

04:46.919 --> 04:47.920
He's out.

04:47.920 --> 04:50.089
Yep. Right on time, huh?

04:50.089 --> 04:51.454
Okay, let's move!

04:56.729 --> 04:57.530
Huh?!

04:57.530 --> 04:59.198
Okay, stop right there.

04:59.198 --> 05:00.859
Who are you?!

05:01.434 --> 05:04.028
Hey, you ain't goin' anywhere!

05:15.548 --> 05:18.642
Aren't we going to get any
cool cases to solve?

05:19.185 --> 05:22.313
Like something exciting
and mysterious?

05:25.658 --> 05:27.160
Ooh, this is good!

05:27.160 --> 05:31.358
It's a homemade shortcake, with farm fresh
strawberries I got through mail-order.

05:31.898 --> 05:35.129
I used some sherry in the jam filling
to bring out their flavor.

05:36.169 --> 05:37.904
You made this yourself?

05:37.904 --> 05:39.072
Awesome!

05:39.072 --> 05:40.573
You can make just about
anything, can't you?

05:40.573 --> 05:42.308
Well, I wouldn't go that far.

05:42.308 --> 05:44.811
No, it's really amazing!

05:44.811 --> 05:48.212
You always do everything by yourself!

05:48.715 --> 05:50.283
Even if Loki weren't here,

05:50.283 --> 05:53.081
I bet you'd be able to do just
fine on your own, right?

05:57.090 --> 05:58.758
No, that's just not possible.

05:58.758 --> 06:01.127
You're so modest!

06:01.127 --> 06:05.064
Hey, why don't you just change the name of
this place to the Yamino Detective Agency?

06:05.064 --> 06:06.793
Oh, no, I'd never...

06:07.967 --> 06:09.635
Hey, why not?

06:09.635 --> 06:11.603
The Yamino Detective Agency.

06:12.772 --> 06:15.400
Oh dear. Not you too, Master Loki!

06:18.544 --> 06:21.240
Mayura really is rather simple, isn't she?

06:26.619 --> 06:29.055
So what did the muggers look like?

06:29.055 --> 06:31.657
They were dressed in black,
and their faces were covered.

06:31.657 --> 06:36.560
All I know is that it was a
pair of younger men.

06:42.735 --> 06:44.669
Okay, let's get outta here.

06:47.507 --> 06:48.906
Ouch.

06:49.175 --> 06:50.642
Yeow...

06:50.910 --> 06:52.612
Watch out, punk!

06:52.612 --> 06:54.477
Watch out yourself!
Why don't you look where you're...

06:55.648 --> 06:56.983
What?

06:56.983 --> 07:01.784
By my reckoning, I'd say you guys
are the muggers, aren't you?

07:03.890 --> 07:05.915
How the heck did you know?

07:06.259 --> 07:09.660
Please! It's a deduction even
a child could have made!

07:15.935 --> 07:16.902
Crap!

07:17.336 --> 07:18.303
Come on!

07:18.638 --> 07:20.503
Whoa! Hey, let go!

07:20.873 --> 07:22.568
If I'm in a car, I...

07:24.143 --> 07:26.611
Okay, we'll get a search underway ASAP.

07:37.290 --> 07:39.815
Oh, I'm done for. I hate cars...

07:56.008 --> 07:56.975
Ecchan?!

07:57.543 --> 07:59.238
That was careless of me.

07:59.545 --> 08:02.139
What is this place?

08:07.019 --> 08:09.455
Oh! I just thought of something fun!

08:09.455 --> 08:11.514
I'll leave this case to the
Yamino Detective Agency!

08:21.234 --> 08:22.223
Huh?

08:30.142 --> 08:32.144
What's this doll doing here?

08:32.144 --> 08:34.237
It looks kind of like Master Loki,
doesn't it?

08:36.682 --> 08:39.617
Good morning, ladies and gentleman
of the Yamino Detective Agency!

08:40.286 --> 08:43.289
The doll spoke! What a mystery!

08:43.289 --> 08:47.225
For Mayura's sake, I note that
this is not a mystery!

08:47.727 --> 08:51.130
This is Loki, and I have left a
recording of my voice in this doll.

08:51.130 --> 08:52.298
Rats!

08:52.298 --> 08:54.634
I am going to give you two a mission.

08:54.634 --> 08:56.035
A mission?

08:56.035 --> 08:59.372
Currently, I've been captured and
imprisoned by a couple of men

08:59.372 --> 09:01.541
who have stolen a large
amount of money.

09:01.541 --> 09:02.975
What?!

09:02.975 --> 09:04.977
It's up to you to find where I'm
being held and rescue me.

09:04.977 --> 09:08.180
If the two of you bungle things,
or fall into danger,

09:08.180 --> 09:08.514
or if the whole thing turns into a
big disaster, it's not my problem,

09:08.514 --> 09:12.485
The Cat Detective 3
or if the whole thing turns into a
big disaster, it's not my problem,

09:12.485 --> 09:14.487
The Cat Detective 3
so keep that in mind.

09:14.487 --> 09:14.620
So keep that in mind.

09:14.620 --> 09:16.455
Well then, I wish you success
in your mission.

09:16.455 --> 09:20.026
What's that supposed to mean?
You don't care what happens to me?!

09:20.026 --> 09:21.493
You're so mean!

09:22.061 --> 09:24.330
We'll have to go and rescue Loki quick.

09:24.330 --> 09:26.933
But how are we supposed to look for him?

09:26.933 --> 09:29.458
Ah! I forgot to give you a hint.

09:33.072 --> 09:34.974
So where am I?

09:34.974 --> 09:38.239
I'll describe what I can see
from here, but in code.

09:38.945 --> 09:40.344
In code?

09:41.247 --> 09:45.585
From where I'm being held,
I can see Hati devouring Skoll.

09:45.585 --> 09:47.712
I'm in the spring of Hvergelmir.

09:48.454 --> 09:50.790
"Hati" devouring "Skoll"...

09:50.790 --> 09:52.959
In the spring of very green seaweed?

09:52.959 --> 09:54.756
The spring of Hvergelmir!

09:55.094 --> 09:56.596
Well, good luck.

09:56.596 --> 10:00.396
If you don't come rescue me quick,
I don't know what they'll do to me.

10:01.267 --> 10:02.868
Stop messing with us, Loki!

10:02.868 --> 10:05.234
Why do you have to speak
in code like that?

10:07.306 --> 10:10.743
This doll will now self-destruct.

10:10.743 --> 10:12.438
I wish you success in your mission.

10:16.449 --> 10:17.507
What a jerk!

10:18.818 --> 10:22.622
Oh. So that was you
transformed into a doll?

10:22.622 --> 10:25.420
Where is Loki right now?

10:28.127 --> 10:29.795
No good, huh?

10:29.795 --> 10:30.129
Can see Hati
devouring skoll.
A spring of
very green seaweed.
Squall?

10:30.129 --> 10:34.934
Can see Hati
devouring skoll.
A spring of
very green seaweed.
Squall?

10:34.934 --> 10:35.229
Can see Hati
devouring skoll.
Aspring of
very green seaweed.
Squall?

10:35.735 --> 10:38.104
I wonder what that's supposed to mean.

10:38.104 --> 10:40.306
It's the spring of Hvergelmir.

10:40.306 --> 10:43.809
Mayura, do you know anything
about Norse mythology?

10:43.809 --> 10:45.106
Norse mythology?

10:48.347 --> 10:51.083
A collection of Scandinavian
tales brought to Europe,

10:51.083 --> 10:54.053
which details the creation of the world
and the exploits of the gods.

10:54.053 --> 10:59.013
All of the names in Loki's code
were from Norse mythology.

11:00.660 --> 11:03.686
So what are Hati and Skoll?

11:05.931 --> 11:08.768
Hati is a wolf who chases the moon.

11:08.768 --> 11:12.226
Skoll is another wolf, who chases the sun.

11:13.572 --> 11:16.742
The reason we have day and night

11:16.742 --> 11:20.079
is that the sun and moon are
being chased by these wolves.

11:20.079 --> 11:22.982
The sun and the moon, huh?

11:22.982 --> 11:25.718
I wonder if Loki could even
be in outer space.

11:25.718 --> 11:27.151
Hey, Mayura!

11:28.387 --> 11:30.556
What are you doing here?

11:30.556 --> 11:33.426
How about you? What are you
doing skipping out on work?

11:33.426 --> 11:34.994
Shopping!

11:34.994 --> 11:38.397
We were out of toilet paper,
so you asked me to buy you some more.

11:38.397 --> 11:39.887
Don't you remember?

11:40.299 --> 11:42.501
Oh, that's right! I'm sorry.

11:42.501 --> 11:45.163
Here, let me give you a ride.
Hop on behind me.

11:46.505 --> 11:49.008
What is it? Don't startle me like that!

11:49.008 --> 11:50.609
Hey, Yamino!

11:50.609 --> 11:53.703
Maybe that thing about the sun and the moon
has something to do with this logo!

11:57.850 --> 11:58.951
I see!

11:58.951 --> 12:02.819
I bet Loki's somewhere within eyeshot
of a convenience store!

12:03.255 --> 12:04.256
Huh?

12:04.256 --> 12:06.158
I'm going to borrow this, Mr. Daidoji!

12:06.158 --> 12:07.493
Me too!

12:07.493 --> 12:09.620
Hey! Wait, Mayura!

12:10.563 --> 12:12.793
My scooter...

12:13.699 --> 12:16.335
I wonder if they'll realize this
is the place from that code.

12:16.335 --> 12:18.860
Maybe it was too hard for them.

12:21.173 --> 12:24.643
I'm hungry. And I'm getting
kind of tired of waiting.

12:24.643 --> 12:26.508
Maybe I should be heading back.

12:31.817 --> 12:32.841
That's...

12:33.085 --> 12:35.554
Always hot, steamy and made with love!

12:35.554 --> 12:37.823
It's Delicious Lunches Catering!

12:37.823 --> 12:39.925
Okay, I've got one Japanese-style
Banquet in a Box

12:39.925 --> 12:42.621
and one of our specialty
Yokozuna Lunch Sets.

12:43.529 --> 12:45.798
Hey, the lunches are here!

12:45.798 --> 12:47.732
All right, I'm coming!

12:48.501 --> 12:49.900
Thanks!

12:51.170 --> 12:53.638
Hey! Narugami!

13:11.390 --> 13:14.052
Whoa, what the heck?

13:18.964 --> 13:21.432
I think I'll just pretend I didn't see that.

14:19.358 --> 14:21.427
It looks like this wasn't the right place.

14:21.427 --> 14:23.054
Let's try to find another one.

14:25.731 --> 14:29.368
But there's a whole bunch of
convenience stores in town!

14:29.368 --> 14:32.371
We'll just have to search every
store we can find.

14:32.371 --> 14:36.034
But what if something happens to Loki
while we're doing all this?

14:38.277 --> 14:40.045
I know. Hey, Yamino.

14:40.045 --> 14:41.535
Yes, what is it?

14:42.248 --> 14:45.046
It's is something that's been
on my mind for a while.

14:47.987 --> 14:51.047
What kind of relationship
do you have with Loki?

14:51.390 --> 14:54.126
What do you mean, "relationship"?

14:54.126 --> 14:59.428
I was wondering why you're always
working so hard looking after him.

15:01.433 --> 15:04.003
It doesn't seem like you're brothers.

15:04.003 --> 15:07.302
Are you cousins or something?

15:07.506 --> 15:09.608
Something like that.

15:09.608 --> 15:13.169
I stay with Master Loki simply because
I want to be of use to him.

15:13.479 --> 15:14.480
Huh?

15:14.480 --> 15:19.351
It's thanks to Master Loki that I'm able to do the
cleaning and laundry, which I love so much.

15:19.351 --> 15:20.978
Yamino...

15:21.720 --> 15:23.517
Hey, there's another convenience
store over there!

15:28.027 --> 15:29.824
Let's go have a look at it.

15:30.796 --> 15:33.766
Okay, we've got all the money we need.

15:33.766 --> 15:35.825
All that's left is to take care
of this guy, right?

15:50.482 --> 15:52.551
The cobra's got some really strong venom.

15:52.551 --> 15:56.388
It'll paralyze you, and you'll suffocate.

15:56.388 --> 15:58.015
It's a tough way to go!

16:21.146 --> 16:25.606
What's going on? Get him! Kill him!

16:31.290 --> 16:33.559
It looks like this wasn't the
right place either.

16:33.559 --> 16:38.097
I wonder if "Hati and Skoll" really does
mean the logo for a convenience store.

16:38.097 --> 16:42.101
By the way, Mayura, what is
that you bought earlier?

16:42.101 --> 16:44.331
It was part of the code, right?

16:45.704 --> 16:47.171
See? Very green seaweed!

16:50.676 --> 16:54.513
But what could "the spring of very
green seaweed" possibly mean?

16:54.513 --> 16:56.913
It's the spring of Hvergelmir!

16:57.516 --> 16:59.518
The spring of Hvergelmir is a place

16:59.518 --> 17:03.318
where an evil dragon named Nidhogg
and countless snakes lie.

17:04.356 --> 17:06.191
Countless snakes?

17:06.191 --> 17:08.182
That's gross!

17:08.494 --> 17:11.793
But there aren't exactly many
snakes here around town.

17:13.265 --> 17:14.562
A snake!

17:18.237 --> 17:18.937
Specializing in Reptiles

17:18.937 --> 17:21.940
Specializing in Reptiles
That pet shop specializes in reptiles!

17:21.940 --> 17:22.167
Specializing in Reptiles

17:23.342 --> 17:27.346
"From where I'm being held,
I can see Hati devouring Skoll."

17:27.346 --> 17:29.314
"I'm in the spring of Hvergelmir."

17:30.849 --> 17:33.010
This could very well be it!

17:36.955 --> 17:38.957
Um, hello?

17:38.957 --> 17:40.083
Yes, ma'am!

17:43.796 --> 17:46.321
I'm sorry, but we're closed today.

17:46.932 --> 17:49.001
I wonder if you'd mind coming
back some other time.

17:49.001 --> 17:51.170
I only need a second!

17:51.170 --> 17:53.338
Could you please show me
some of your snakes?

17:53.338 --> 17:56.642
The truth is, I really love snakes!

17:56.642 --> 17:58.510
Oh, really?

17:58.510 --> 18:02.514
Actually, we'll soon be receiving an
extremely rare type of snake!

18:02.514 --> 18:07.213
It's incredibly expensive, but something that
no snake lover could stand to be without!

18:09.755 --> 18:11.723
I can't stand it!

18:11.790 --> 18:13.592
Yamino...

18:13.592 --> 18:17.892
Mayura, you pretend to be a customer
and distract whoever's inside.

18:18.697 --> 18:22.497
While you're doing that, I'll sneak in
and rescue Master Loki.

18:29.575 --> 18:30.940
You little bastard!

18:33.045 --> 18:35.180
Who the hell are you?!

18:35.180 --> 18:36.548
Why aren't you freaking out?!

18:36.548 --> 18:38.784
There really are a lot of snakes here.

18:38.784 --> 18:42.584
It's just like the spring of Hvergelmir
from Norse mythology.

18:42.888 --> 18:44.856
What the heck is that?

18:45.557 --> 18:48.293
Do you know anything about the
giant serpent, Midgardsormr?

18:48.293 --> 18:51.558
He's so huge that he encircles
the entire Earth.

18:51.897 --> 18:53.194
Master Loki!

18:56.034 --> 18:57.331
Don't move!

18:59.471 --> 19:02.565
Come any closer and the kid's dead!

19:03.742 --> 19:05.244
Are you sure about that?

19:05.244 --> 19:06.445
What?

19:06.445 --> 19:10.882
You'll lose not only your life,
but your soul as well.

19:13.118 --> 19:14.585
What the hell?!

19:14.887 --> 19:16.688
Oh, lucky you!

19:16.688 --> 19:20.055
Now you'll be able to see that
legendary serpent firsthand.

19:38.944 --> 19:40.809
You're late.

19:41.346 --> 19:43.644
I'm sorry, Father.

19:46.351 --> 19:48.820
Picking up where I left off earlier,

19:48.820 --> 19:52.449
the father of this giant serpent is
known as the dark god Loki.

19:53.325 --> 19:56.624
And I happen to be that Loki.

19:57.729 --> 19:59.731
Consider this punishment for
making me ride in a car.

19:59.731 --> 20:01.028
Eat him!

20:13.312 --> 20:14.980
Don't either of you move!

20:14.980 --> 20:15.480
Crap, the police!
Don't either of you move!

20:15.480 --> 20:16.648
Crap, the police!

20:16.648 --> 20:18.081
Don't try to run!

20:22.354 --> 20:23.855
You're Daidoji's daughter?!

20:23.855 --> 20:26.091
Ah, Detective Niyama!

20:26.091 --> 20:28.260
What are you doing here?

20:28.260 --> 20:30.996
Inspector! It's the stolen money!

20:30.996 --> 20:31.792
Good.

20:33.599 --> 20:34.725
Loki!

20:40.739 --> 20:42.407
You two again?

20:42.407 --> 20:44.176
Thank goodness you're okay!

20:44.176 --> 20:46.906
Yes, we're all right now.

20:51.617 --> 20:55.018
Come on, you two must be starving.

20:55.754 --> 20:59.212
I've prepared my very best Mapo Tofu.

21:00.592 --> 21:03.161
Of course, the spicy tobanjan paste
in the sauce is authentic

21:03.161 --> 21:05.063
and imported directly from China.

21:05.063 --> 21:06.365
Wow, it looks delicious!

21:06.365 --> 21:06.999
Thanks for the meal!
Wow, it looks delicious!

21:06.999 --> 21:07.488
Thanks for the meal!

21:08.800 --> 21:11.370
You sure are amazing, Yamino!

21:11.370 --> 21:14.906
After all, you're the one who rescued Loki!

21:14.906 --> 21:17.602
You really can do anything on your own!

21:19.444 --> 21:21.780
Nothing of the sort!

21:21.780 --> 21:25.443
I simply do whatever I can
to please Master Loki!

21:25.717 --> 21:29.021
But the Yamino Detective Agency
was a big success, wasn't it?

21:29.021 --> 21:31.523
It's the Enjaku Detective Agency.

21:31.523 --> 21:32.990
Isn't that right, Master Loki?

21:36.461 --> 21:37.758
This is delicious.

21:49.141 --> 21:51.939
I will use my magic on you.

21:52.544 --> 21:55.012
You're coming with me on a journey.

22:16.968 --> 22:28.937
Fukai kiri wo saite tsukiakari ga terashita michi

22:30.615 --> 22:42.361
Daremo mina mayoinagara,
samayotteru ashita e to

22:42.361 --> 22:49.568
Kodoku no machi de kataritsugu shinwa sae

22:49.568 --> 22:55.907
Habamaresou na yami wo nukete yuku

22:55.907 --> 23:05.417
Hatenai sora wo koete tabi wo shite iru

23:05.417 --> 23:09.755
Kizutsuitemo

23:09.755 --> 23:21.767
Boku-tachi wa kitto tadoritsukeru kara,
inori-tsuzuketai

23:21.767 --> 23:23.496
Believe in Heaven

23:31.410 --> 23:31.777
Next Episode

23:31.777 --> 23:34.679
Next Episode
The next episode's key words are,
"leaf," "prayer," and "quiz."

23:34.679 --> 23:35.313
Next Episode
Greens!

23:35.313 --> 23:36.081
Next Episode
No, leaves.

23:36.081 --> 23:38.049
Next Episode
Hey, Mayura, do you pray?

23:38.049 --> 23:40.452
Next Episode
No, I don't do prayers,
but sometimes I do charms!

23:40.452 --> 23:41.720
Next Episode
Charms? Like what?

23:41.720 --> 23:43.889
Next Episode
"Listen when people are talking to you,

23:43.889 --> 23:45.924
Next Episode
and look them right in the moustache."

23:45.924 --> 23:48.260
Next Episode
That's a nursery rhyme, not a charm.
And you got the last part wrong.

23:48.260 --> 23:49.561
Next Episode
It's not "mustache."

23:49.561 --> 23:51.196
Next Episode
Huh? No, it really is!

23:51.196 --> 23:52.931
